/**
 * editControls — the shared edit-mode UI extracted out of the three PMESII
 * edit-affordance call sites (#2148/#2149): `DimensionBanner.tsx` (the 2
 * dimension summaries), `SubSectionCard.tsx` (the 8 sub-section cards' Edit
 * button/hint + focus-return), and `SubSectionEditForm.tsx` (the Save/Cancel
 * pair + error alert inside an open edit session). All three independently
 * grew byte-identical markup, class strings, and Save/Cancel/error/409
 * handling — this module is the single extraction point for that
 * duplication. Every exported piece renders (or computes) EXACTLY what those
 * three components rendered/computed before this file existed; wave-2 work
 * rewires each of them to import from here instead of inlining their own
 * copy, with no DOM output change.
 *
 * The 409-CAS-conflict-exits-edit-mode rule (all three call sites treat a
 * 409 `RangeApiError` as "show the conflict copy and drop out of edit mode";
 * anything else keeps the session open with its own message) now lives in
 * exactly one place: `classifySaveError`.
